[00:07.915]Three cheers for the master plan
{"为这宏图大计三呼万岁"}
[00:11.159]Clenched fist with a broken hand
{"断手仍紧握成拳"}
[00:14.070]Stuck in a corner, stuck in a corner
{"困在角落　困在角落"}
[00:20.480]False start, with no second chance
{"错误起步　再无转圜"}
[00:23.658]Built your house on a bed of sand, now it's
{"你将房屋建在流沙上　如今"}
[00:26.762]It's underwater, it's underwater
{"它沉入水底　沉入水底"}
[00:32.713]Back up, bad luck, she's at it again
{"退后　厄运　她又故技重施"}
[00:38.353]Yeah, I got a real big problem and she don't care
{"我有个天大的难题　她却毫不在意"}
[00:45.871]So sick and tired of coming in last
{"受够了总是垫底"}
[00:51.630]I'm spitting blood, I'm chewing glass
{"我口吐鲜血　咀嚼玻璃"}
[00:58.267]Got tricked by a pretty lie
{"被美丽的谎言蒙蔽"}
[01:01.235]It's no greener on the other side
{"彼岸并非更绿"}
[01:03.671]Like a lamb to the slaughter, lamb to the slaughter
{"如待宰羔羊　待宰羔羊"}
[01:10.739]Don't care if I live or die
{"生死于我皆无谓"}
[01:13.989]Modern life is a firefight, and I'm
{"现代生活是场枪林弹雨　而我"}
[01:16.918]I'm not a soldier, I'm not a soldier
{"并非士兵　并非士兵"}
[01:22.728]Woo!
[01:23.685]Back up, bad luck, she's at it again
{"退后　厄运　她又故技重施"}
[01:28.277]Yeah, I got a real big problem and she don't care
{"我有个天大的难题　她却毫不在意"}
[01:35.607]So sick and tired of coming in last
{"受够了总是垫底"}
[01:42.362]I'm spitting blood, I'm chewing glass
{"我口吐鲜血　咀嚼玻璃"}
[02:16.704]Back up, bad luck, she's at it again
